">\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.webmanifest\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon-192.png\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"Tefsiri: Al-Kawthar 108:3 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü'l-Kayyim'e göre\", \"description\": \"Şüphesiz asıl sana kin besleyenin soyu kesiktir.\", \"inLanguage\": \"tr\", \"url\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/108-3.html\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/108-3.html\", \"image\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye\"}, {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"İmam İbnü'l-Kayyim\"}], \"isPartOf\": {\"@type\": \"WebSite\", \"name\": \"Tefsîru'ş-Şeyhayn\", \"url\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Al-Kawthar\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/108.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 3\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/108-3.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}.langs{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto 0;font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted)}.langs a{color:var(--lapis)}</style>\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-ER9F5C2HC1\"></script>\n<script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments)}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-ER9F5C2HC1',{allow_google_signals:false,allow_ad_personalization_signals:false});</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/108.html\">Sûre Al-Kawthar</a> › Âyet 3</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Al-Kawthar 108:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ الْأَبْتَرُ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Şüphesiz asıl sana kin besleyenin soyu kesiktir.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وفي قوله: {إن شانئك هو الأبتر} أنواع من التأكيد: أحدها تصدير الجملة بإن. الثاني: الإتيان بضمير الفصل الدال على قوة الإسناد والاختصاص. الثالث: مجيء الخبر على أفعل التفضيل. دون اسم المفعول. الرابع: تعريفه باللام الدالة على حصول هذا الموصوف له بتمامه. وأنه أحق به من غيره<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/533</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله {إن شانئك} أي مبغضك والأبتر المقطوع النسل الذي لا يولد له خير ولا عمل صالح فلا يتولد عنه خير ولا عمل صالح.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/528</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s108a3\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/108-2.html\">Önceki âyet (108:2)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" aria-label=\"Language\">🌐 <a href=\"/ayah/108-3.html\" hreflang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" data-l=\"ar\">العربية</a> · <a